# The native library, cross-compiled from `isekai-client-ffi`. A large build
# artifact (~200 MB unstripped debug), produced by `cargo ndk` -- see the
# `generateJniLibs` task in `app/build.gradle.kts`.
app/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so

# The Kotlin bindings, generated from the built library by `uniffi-bindgen`.
#
# **Not committed, deliberately.** They are generated from the Rust interface,
# so a copy in the tree is a copy that goes stale: the interface changes, this
# does not, and nothing says so until an app that compiled fine fails at
# runtime. iOS generates its Swift bindings the same way and for the same
# reason. `generateUniFfiBindings` writes them here.
app/build/generated/uniffi/
